cff-version: 1.2.0

message: "If you use Tandem Repeat Explorer (T-REx) in your research, please cite this software."

title: "Tandem Repeat Explorer (T-REx)"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Zeni"
    given-names: "Rodrigo"

abstract: >-
  Tandem Repeat Explorer (T-REx) is a modular Bash/Python toolkit
  for the identification, characterization, and visualization of
  tandem repeat arrays from genome assemblies and short-read
  sequencing data.

repository-code: "https://github.com/zenirodrigo/TandemRepeatEXplorer"

url: "https://github.com/zenirodrigo/TandemRepeatEXplorer"

license: MIT

keywords:
  - satellite DNA
  - genomics
